<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Legato cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Legato cut on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it downgraded Legato Systems Inc to hold from buy on price.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell one to 45-1/4.</p>
</text>
